The statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-9a5893e3c40fbef252328139205a7652e5544f9f "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. The schedule specifies that ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years before shredding[[cite:obs-fdd6085a10db04c1e29a11cc179b58e27df838e2 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].